      "id": "at-glance",
      "title": "At a glance",
      "body": "Chị khỏe không? is the friendly how are you for an older woman, adult female helper, guide, teacher, or staff member. It sounds more local than using bạn when the woman is clearly older or socially senior."
    },
    {
      "id": "standard-way",
      "title": "The standard way",
      "body": "Use this after Dạ, chào chị or Chào chị when the greeting has opened into a friendly exchange.",
